    "phone.a": "Machine learning is a branch of artificial intelligence where computers **learn from data** instead of being explicitly programmed.\n\nKey concepts:\n\n• **Training**: feeding data to algorithms\n• **Models**: learned patterns from data\n• **Inference**: making predictions on new data",
